# SLICE-01 "Torch": a torch effect authored on the new VFX system (Content/VFX/Torch.dfx, three emitters - Flame
# (additive, size and colour over life by curves), Smoke (translucent, grows and fades by curves, curl noise),
# Embers (additive, curl noise, colour over life)) placed on the Starter scene's Campfire entity (300, 0, 250) in
# place of Campfire.dfx, simulated 3 s, shot from three angles; then Stop, Simulate again and the same 3 s must
# give the same side frame (the system Seed 4711 + entity UUID fix every emitter's random stream).
# The scenario does NOT save the scene: the System change is an unsaved edit of Starter.desce.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано set 1414213562373095048 VFX.System assets:VFX/Torch.dfx
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 1.5
Когда advance 1.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 300,110,-200
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.02,1
Тогда-вид 0_side a torch flame (narrow, tall, yellow-white core to orange tips) with a grey smoke column rising above it and small orange embers drifting up - not the wide campfire
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 300,418,-68
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.707,0.707
Тогда-вид 1_above the same effect from 45 degrees above, the smoke column readable over the flame
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 300,550,252
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,0.01
Тогда-вид 2_top the flame seen from the top: a bright round core with smoke spreading around it
Когда run Action Stop
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 1.5
Когда advance 1.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 300,110,-200
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.02,1
Тогда-вид 3_replay the same frame as 0_side after Stop and a second Simulate of the same 3 s
Когда run Action Stop
